===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*gʰreh₁-}}
From {{suffix|en|grow|th|id2=abstract nominal|pos2=abstract nominal suffix}}. Compare {{cog|ofs|grēd}} {{gloss|"meadow, pasture"; > {{cog|frr|greyde|t=growth, pasture}}}}, {{cog|gmh|gruote}}, {{m|gmh|gruot|t=greens, fresh growth, shoot}}, {{cog|non|gróðr}} {{gloss|"growth, crop"; > {{cog|fo|grøði}}, {{cog|da|grøde|t=fruits}}, {{cog|sv|gröda|t=crop, harvest}}}}. More at {{l|en|grow}}.

